SourceTrait Box establishes the concept of a system contract; layered system level guarantees that can be safely expected and built upon.

Guarantees:
- Linux, RedHat variants
- Nushell, default shell
- User directories (~/): .sys ai data info proj repo tmp
- Environment variables exist ($env):
  - XDG_: [CACHE CONFIG DATA STATE]_HOME
  - XDGX_: [TMP LIBRARY ASSET PACKAGE SECRET_DATA]_HOME SHM_DIR
- Most dot files/dirs: ~/.sys/

Preferences:
- Nu: Scripting, Tooling
- NUON: Data
- YAML: Configuration, User-facing data
- Liquid: Templating
- Markdown: Documentation
- Rust: Software

Conventions:
- snake_casing: Variables, Functions, Commands, Filepaths
- CamelCasing: Concepts, Tasks